WEBVTT

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:26.830
Whoa! So, this is the gateway to Chuohku.

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:35.830
Looks like they spent an
awful lot of money on security.

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:37.660
Hey there! Ichiro!

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:39.660
Whoa! What's the big idea?!

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:42.370
Hey now! It's <i>me</i>, Ichiro!

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:45.370
Ramuda! Don't go around
flinging yourself at people like that!

00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:46.950
Eh-hehehe!

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:51.700
Ramuda, thou shalt not unduly fraternize
with those we may engage in battle.

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:53.120
I don't see any harm in it, do you?

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:56.040
Since <i>we're </i>the ones who are gonna win and all.

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:58.910
Well, that is also an accurate assessment.

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:08.910
Brother Ichi, behind you...

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:11.500
Matenro has arrived.

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:13.950
It's been a while, Ichiro.

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:15.750
And...

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:17.500
Amemura, as well.

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:19.290
Dr. Jakurai, how goes it?

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:23.250
Blech... It's that old coot Jakurai...

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:27.080
Ah-haha! Jakurai, long time, no see!

00:01:27.080 --> 00:01:29.700
I <i>heard </i>that, Amemura.

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:33.540
Why, I don't know <i>what </i>you mean!

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:35.080
Howdy, guys!

00:01:35.080 --> 00:01:37.950
I'm Matenro's Hifumi Izanami!

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:40.750
But my friends call me Hifuming!

00:01:40.750 --> 00:01:43.830
Uh, yeah. I'm Ichiro Yamada.

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:45.330
P-Please forgive him...

00:01:45.330 --> 00:01:48.120
He can be so rude...

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:51.450
Uh, sure. It's not a problem.

00:01:51.450 --> 00:01:53.160
Well, well!

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:55.370
It appears as though everyone's here.

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:02.870
Hmm. Everyone here looks so formidable.

00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:06.750
I look forward to finding out just
how worthy an opponent they really are.

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:14.750
Ichiro Yamada, you hypocritical
piece of shit, I've missed you <i>so </i>much.

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:17.200
Yeah, same here.

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:19.200
Samatoki! Long time, no see!

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:20.750
Get off me, you pain in the ass!

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:22.830
What's wrong with it?
I haven't seen you such a long time!

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:26.250
Why, you! If you don't cut it out,
I'll pulverize ya, you little twat!

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:27.750
Hey!

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:31.700
It's not polite to disappear
suddenly while someone's talking.

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:33.410
Bleah!

00:02:33.410 --> 00:02:34.830
Samatoki!

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:37.660
That's Samatoki, <i>sir</i>, to you,
you stinkin' sack of shit!

00:02:37.660 --> 00:02:41.080
I don't have an ounce of respect
for you the way you are now!

00:02:41.080 --> 00:02:42.620
Oh, this should be fun...

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:45.540
I'll muzzle that smart-ass mouth of yours...

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:47.580
Right here, right now!

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:51.790
It's not like I'm bothering you
or anything, Jakurai.

00:02:51.790 --> 00:02:54.700
Won't you just leave me alone?

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:57.370
It pains me terribly to say this, but...

00:02:57.370 --> 00:03:01.200
...it appears that I just cannot
bring myself to like you.

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.370
Eh-heh! Don't worry about it!

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:05.290
Wanna know why, Jakurai? 'Cause I...

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:08.660
...really, really, really,
really hate your guts, too!

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:12.620
Get ready for an ass-whipping!

00:03:12.620 --> 00:03:15.790
Heh! Sez you!

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:18.950
Ah-heh! Drop dead now, okay!

00:03:18.950 --> 00:03:23.540
You leave me no other choice.
This is an act of self-defense!

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:26.620
Enough, you swine!

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:29.000
--Huh?!
--Huh?!
--Huh?!

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.410
Huh?!

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:46.000
She's...

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:47.910
Th-There're so many women...

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:50.410
Da fuck's yer problem?!

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:52.700
Are you asking to be disqualified?

00:03:52.700 --> 00:03:54.580
Just try it, you fuckin' bitch!

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:55.950
You imbecile!

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:58.870
That's Ichijiku Kadenokoji.
She's the Special Advisor to the Prime Minister,

00:03:58.870 --> 00:04:02.790
Superintendent General of the
Metropolitan Police Department,

00:04:02.790 --> 00:04:04.950
and Director of the
Administrative Inspection Bureau.

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:06.790
With a snap of her fingers,

00:04:06.790 --> 00:04:09.160
she can do with us as she sees fit!

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:11.080
Like any of that matters!

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:14.620
This is exactly why, you barbaric men...

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:16.410
An important match is about to start.

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:18.370
I'll let you off with a warning just this once.

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:20.290
Now, hurry up and get ready!

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:30.330
Ramuda, what's the matter?

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:33.500
Ah-heh! Nothing's the matter!

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:37.370
I was just thinking about
what a scary lady that was.

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:39.700
Come, ye two! Let us be on our way.

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:42.830
Should we remain here, Ramuda is likely
to get himself into another altercation.

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:46.540
Hey! I won't do that anymore, I promise!

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:48.290
So thou sayest...

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:49.660
Bleah!

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:55.410
U-Um, Doctor, are you all right?

00:04:55.410 --> 00:04:59.410
Please forgive me for behaving so childishly.

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:01.200
N-No, we didn't think you...

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:05.160
It's so totally not like you
to get all testy like that, Doctor.

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:08.370
It just shows you that I, too,
am still far from perfect.

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:11.410
Come, let us also be on our way.

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:23.040
--Big Bro...
--Hmm?

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:27.580
Brother Ichi, what happened between you and him?

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:32.790
Samatoki.... tried to kill you two.

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:34.290
I'll never forgive him.

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:39.500
Are you talking about the time that
Saburo and I were abducted by Chuohku?

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:40.790
Yeah...

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:55.160
Samatoki?!

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:57.830
Sir?! I'm begging you!

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:00.950
If you press that button,
my kid brothers will...

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:03.040
Like I give a fuck.

00:08:04.700 --> 00:08:09.250
Samatoki! Don't!

00:08:09.910 --> 00:08:13.830
Th-That's what happened, huh?

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:16.870
Samatoki Aohitsugi...

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:21.000
I'll tear that asshole a new one, I swear...

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:23.700
Brother Ichi, I'll pitch in, too!

00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:25.250
Let's do our best together!

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:27.450
Big Bro! I'm here for you, too, you know?

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:29.450
I'm more useful than Saburo over here!

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:31.790
What are you going on about?
<i>I'm </i>the one that spoke up first.

00:08:31.790 --> 00:08:33.700
I'm just tellin' it like it is, man.

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:37.540
I'm a <i>heck </i>of a lot more useful than <i>you </i>are.

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:40.000
Yeah, guys. I'm counting on you! Jiro, Saburo!

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:41.200
--Yeah!
--OK!

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:55.080
Ow! Tsk! God damn it!

00:08:55.540 --> 00:09:00.160
Ichiro Yamada... Did something
happen between the two of you?

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:03.750
We are a team.

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:07.200
There may be something we can assist you with.

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:08.580
Tell us what happened.

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:19.450
Nemu left me on account of that bastard.

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:22.660
Nemu, your younger sister?

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:28.660
Nemu!

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:32.540
I believe what Ichiro told me,
and I've made up my mind.

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:35.250
So, you'd better not stand in my way!

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:43.870
I won't be satisfied till that
asshole gets what's comin' to him

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:46.450
for smooth talkin' her.

00:09:46.450 --> 00:09:50.790
Hmm. In that case,
let us handle the two younger brothers.

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:53.040
He's right.

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:56.120
We'll make every effort to ensure
that no one interferes with you.

00:09:56.120 --> 00:09:58.160
Thanks, guys, I owe ya one.

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:17.660
We will now hold the final tournament
of the First Division Rap Battle!

00:10:30.410 --> 00:10:38.290
Ms. Otome Tohoten, head of the Party of Words,
will make the opening remarks!

00:10:38.290 --> 00:10:43.950
The rule of force and the wicked practice
of bloodshed has come to an end,

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:47.830
and a new age has dawned in
which the power of words holds sway.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:52.040
Each team uses words
to vie for each other's territory.

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:56.700
This serves as proof that words
are imbued with power.

00:10:56.700 --> 00:11:00.790
Now, take up that mic
and demonstrate your might!

00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:07.580
The final tournament of the
First Division Rap Battle will now begin!

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:14.750
Now, let us review the tournament rules!

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:15.370
"LOSS CONDITIONS"
"VICTORY CONDITIONS"

00:11:15.370 --> 00:11:17.750
"LOSS CONDITIONS"
"VICTORY CONDITIONS"

00:11:15.370 --> 00:11:17.750
The time limit is 30 minutes.

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:20.040
"LOSS CONDITIONS"
"VICTORY CONDITIONS"

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:20.040
Anyone that doesn't get up
after a ten-count, gives up,

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:24.660
"LOSS CONDITIONS"
"VICTORY CONDITIONS"

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:24.660
or is out of the ring for 30 seconds
or longer will be disqualified!

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:30.750
The winning team is the one with
the most survivors at the end of the time limit

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:33.450
or the one that completely
defeats the opposing team!

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:40.080
We will now begin the first battle!

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:43.080
White side up means
Buster Bros!!! gets the first attack.

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:46.700
Black side up means MAD TRIGGER CREW gets it.

00:11:52.950 --> 00:11:54.290
And the first attack goes to...

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:56.080
...Buster Bros!!!

00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:01.580
And now, for the first battle!

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:03.950
Get Ready...

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:11.000
Bring The Beat!!!

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:16.290
I'm up first, you goddamn pig!

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:17.830
H-Hey, Jiro!

00:12:17.830 --> 00:12:20.000
♬ Looks like
Your calculations were way off ♬

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:21.250
♬ Gonna drop you
Dirty cop ♬

00:12:21.250 --> 00:12:22.660
♬ Right on the spot ♬

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:24.120
♬ Don't worry about those glasses and gloves ♬

00:12:24.120 --> 00:12:25.500
♬ Odd Jobs Yamada'll hold onto 'em for ya ♬

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:27.910
♬ While we liquidate your estate
In an open showcase ♬

00:12:27.910 --> 00:12:29.290
♬ Surpassing all expectations ♬

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:30.750
♬ The rarest case
Super rookie ♬

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:32.950
♬ Hope you got the balls
To go up against me ♬

00:12:32.950 --> 00:12:35.410
♬ I'm startin' to get tired
of that smirk on your face ♬

00:12:35.410 --> 00:12:37.410
♬ Kissing ass seems more your pace ♬

00:12:37.410 --> 00:12:38.620
♬ Holla ♬

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:49.620
You did better than I expected but
try not to get crushed after one verse.

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:54.450
♬ I am the law, so I make the rules
You impotent fools ♬

00:12:54.450 --> 00:12:57.120
♬ Don't get to choose
No matter what becomes of you ♬

00:12:57.120 --> 00:12:59.540
♬ A total amateur
Brother working your controls ♬

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:00.750
♬ The difference is plain to see ♬

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:02.540
♬ Between Jiro Yamada and me ♬

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:04.540
♬ And that makes me happy as can be ♬

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:07.160
♬ You came all this way just to turn yourself in? ♬

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:09.660
♬ Can't say I care for babysitting children ♬

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:13.080
♬ Idiots have no shot at winning
Thanks for your understanding ♬

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:15.540
Gahhh! Ungh!

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:17.540
--Jiro!
--Eh-hehe...

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:20.080
Just lost my balance there for a sec.

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:23.500
Did I get a little carried away, perhaps?

00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:28.370
Hmph! Nope, it was just the thing
to shake off my morning drowsiness.

00:13:29.080 --> 00:13:30.500
Hey you, Navy vet!

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:34.000
I'll make that calm face of yours twist in pain!

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:36.950
Hmph! I'd like to see you try it.

00:13:36.950 --> 00:13:40.160
♬ So, how long do you get to keep
calling yourself a "Navy vet" ♬

00:13:40.160 --> 00:13:42.540
♬ You know that's just
a synonym for unemployment ♬

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:44.330
♬ Why don't you just concede you've been beat? ♬

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:45.750
♬ What use are adults who don't get paid? ♬

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:47.450
♬ Get a job and make some hay ♬

00:13:47.450 --> 00:13:50.080
♬ Y to the A-M-A-D-A ♬

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:52.620
♬ We got some l33t DNA ♬

00:13:52.620 --> 00:13:54.950
♬ Stubborn adults are embarrassingly passé ♬

00:13:54.950 --> 00:13:58.370
♬ Have fun playing pretend, soldier-boy cliché! ♬

00:14:05.330 --> 00:14:09.290
Hmm, for a boy you did better than I expected.

00:14:09.290 --> 00:14:12.620
But your efforts have no effect on me.

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:15.250
♬ Now that's a good one, but I'm still a hired gun ♬

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:17.790
♬ And I'll grab my mic
this instant to get this done ♬

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:20.200
♬ This might be your first battle, son
But it's an ill-conceived campaign ♬

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:22.790
♬ So let me explain:
You aren't getting out of this in one piece ♬

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:24.160
♬ Punchlines are a weapon I wield with ease ♬

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:27.910
♬ Any mistakes will lead to defeat
First of all, this is a real warzone ♬

00:14:27.910 --> 00:14:30.500
♬ Air on G will be a Requiem all your own ♬

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:33.660
♬ All your blind loyalty will
earn you is a double promotion ♬

00:14:35.790 --> 00:14:38.750
Gwahh!

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:40.870
Saburo!

00:14:40.870 --> 00:14:43.250
Everything's fine!

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:49.700
Finally, it's you versus me, Ichiro...

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:51.250
Samatoki...

00:14:51.250 --> 00:14:53.200
I'll crush you here and now!

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:58.200
Hmph! In that case, I'll fuckin' slaughter ya!

00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:00.910
♬ It's judgement day for you, Samatoki ♬

00:15:00.910 --> 00:15:03.160
♬ I'll cut you and your nonsense down to size ♬

00:15:03.160 --> 00:15:05.950
♬ You'll be in a hospital bed
next time you open your eyes ♬

00:15:05.950 --> 00:15:08.290
♬ I'll rock you with my flow
until you can't get up no more ♬

00:15:08.290 --> 00:15:09.700
♬ I'm so slick, I'll make you motion sick ♬

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:10.910
♬ My skills don't need no introduction ♬

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:13.330
♬ Your scrambled brains will serve that function
Nobody wants to hear your name ♬

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:14.750
♬ We've all heard it a thousand times ♬

00:15:14.750 --> 00:15:16.040
♬ Kill first, ask questions later ♬

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:19.000
♬ You're already in the morgue
Need me to ID your corpse? ♬

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:25.160
--Yes!
--This should...

00:15:32.120 --> 00:15:34.620
Now it's <i>my </i>turn!

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:38.700
♬ You're just a sore loser clinging to the rules ♬

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:41.120
♬ Your only asset is being as stubborn as a mule ♬

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:43.700
♬ That soft and dainty flow ♬

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:46.290
♬ Ain't carving anyone's gravestone ♬

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:48.790
♬ You're a dime-a-dozen hooligan
And I'm gonna eat you for lunch ♬

00:15:48.790 --> 00:15:51.290
♬ I've got another busy day
Of burning hypocrites at the stake ♬

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:52.790
♬ Violence is a serious undertaking ♬

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:54.500
♬ That's your cross to bear ♬

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:56.870
♬ I'm THE Samatoki, make no mistake ♬

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:05.910
Ungh!

00:16:05.910 --> 00:16:07.620
--Big Bro!
--Brother Ichi!

00:16:07.620 --> 00:16:12.540
C'mon, now! Don't keel over
'cause of somethin' like this!

00:16:12.540 --> 00:16:15.330
♬ I'm not interested in some pale
white corpse's philosophy ♬

00:16:15.330 --> 00:16:16.620
♬ My stats are almost comically ♬

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:17.830
♬ High quality ♬

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:19.120
♬ You're toppling over ♬

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:21.080
♬ Right into hell, see?
What's wrong? ♬

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:23.580
♬ Breakin' down all the time
Must be outta your prime ♬

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:32.330
Hahahahaha! HAH HAH HAH HAH HAH HAH!

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:35.580
♬ You just don't know when to stop
With the impudent back-talk ♬

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:37.750
♬ You can cry all you want
But you know in your head ♬

00:16:37.750 --> 00:16:39.500
♬ That in the end, you'll wind up dead ♬

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:41.870
♬ You idiot vigilantes think that you're so tough? ♬

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:44.910
♬ Well, blah, blah, blah, blah--I've had enough ♬

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:53.120
Gwahhh-gahhh!

00:16:56.870 --> 00:17:01.660
You always were a pain in the ass, Samatoki!

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:06.700
The lights of his speakers are
glowing brighter than they were before.

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:10.410
You think he's gotten stronger?

00:17:14.660 --> 00:17:18.250
This is Samatoki Aohitsugi's rap ability.

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:23.620
Whenever he's attacked,
his rage accumulates, increasing his power.

00:17:23.620 --> 00:17:25.660
It's quite a potent ability.

00:17:25.660 --> 00:17:30.200
The longer the battle drags on,
the more it puts Buster Bros!!! at a disadvantage.

00:17:30.200 --> 00:17:32.750
No, that's not necessarily the case.

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:35.000
And why is that?

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:37.370
Because Ichiro Yamada's rap ability is

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:42.290
extremely incompatible
with Samatoki Aohitsugi's.

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:45.200
Depending on how they time it,
we won't know who the victor is.

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:49.080
This is proving to be quite a spectacle.

00:17:52.700 --> 00:17:54.830
This ain't over yet, now is it?

00:17:54.830 --> 00:17:56.620
Of course it's not!

00:17:56.620 --> 00:17:58.330
C'mon! Jiro! Saburo!

00:17:58.330 --> 00:17:59.950
--Yeah!
--OK!

00:18:02.700 --> 00:18:04.160
♬ We are the Buster Bros!!! ♬

00:18:04.160 --> 00:18:05.410
♬ Gonna knock out all of our foes ♬

00:18:05.410 --> 00:18:06.700
♬ Next up is the explosives course ♬

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:07.910
♬ And we won't be showing any remorse ♬

00:18:07.910 --> 00:18:10.290
♬ Saburo's custom mode
Even though I can read you all cold ♬

00:18:10.290 --> 00:18:12.830
♬ When you're all too stupid to comprehend
It's a total wash in the end ♬

00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:14.080
♬ But I'm taking a firm stand ♬

00:18:14.080 --> 00:18:15.410
♬ Demonstrating the strong bond we have ♬

00:18:15.410 --> 00:18:16.620
♬ By subjugating ♬

00:18:16.620 --> 00:18:17.870
♬ These rhyme desecrating
Mobsters ♬

00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:20.540
♬ Sure sounds like anything goes
Why don't we call it Vale Tudo? ♬

00:18:20.540 --> 00:18:23.450
♬ With that level of brain damage
You guys are at a serious disadvantage ♬

00:18:32.700 --> 00:18:36.200
Let's KO the whole lot of 'em!

00:18:36.200 --> 00:18:39.120
It's about time we ended this.

00:18:39.120 --> 00:18:41.200
Roger that.

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:43.080
Watch out! Here comes a big one!

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:45.660
♬ MAD TRIGGER CREW
Is having you over for a full course meal ♬

00:18:45.660 --> 00:18:48.040
♬ A rich wine is part of the appeal
Fragrant like Lambrusco Amabile ♬

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:50.700
♬ But the children will have
to have grape juice, that's the deal ♬

00:18:50.700 --> 00:18:53.040
♬ Sorry, but I'd rather die than settle
For getting down on a kid's level ♬

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:55.660
♬ Death is the only recourse
Gotta snuff 'em out at the source ♬

00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:58.250
♬ There's no trick to takin' out
child soldier forces, right? Rio? ♬

00:18:58.250 --> 00:19:00.790
♬ Ignoring a power imbalance
is a serious war crime ♬

00:19:00.790 --> 00:19:03.910
♬ But you jerks don't get to disturb
the peace in the meantime ♬

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:20.830
Jiro! Saburo! Let's sock it to 'em!

00:19:20.830 --> 00:19:23.410
♬ Age is nothing but a number
As this prodigy's here to prove ♬

00:19:23.410 --> 00:19:26.040
♬ We're bustin' in head-on--it's your move
Gonna leave your brains full of bruises ♬

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:28.580
♬ I ain't sayin' this out of blind faith
The Yamada bloodline is hella first-rate ♬

00:19:28.580 --> 00:19:31.450
--♬ You best know you're dead meat! ♬
--♬ You don't have what it takes to compete ♬

00:19:33.660 --> 00:19:36.330
♬ Call in the riot squad
Make this sadist mad-- ♬

00:19:36.330 --> 00:19:38.620
♬ And get treated to an assault rifle
Blowing out your brains to end your life ♬

00:19:38.620 --> 00:19:41.200
♬ Look at the baby brigade sulking
Lookin' real tragic over there ♬

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:44.410
--♬ Unarmed, plainclothes troops ♬
--♬ In other words, civilians ♬

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:54.830
Jiro! Saburo!

00:19:57.540 --> 00:20:00.750
We cleaned house,
starting with your useless kid brothers.

00:20:00.750 --> 00:20:03.750
SA-MA-TO-KI!

00:20:03.750 --> 00:20:06.370
♬ The passes we brothers all possess ♬

00:20:06.370 --> 00:20:08.870
♬ Are an all expense ticket
to the Bus Bro Express! ♬

00:20:08.870 --> 00:20:11.580
♬ You won't find any
snot-nosed brats on these streets ♬

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:14.830
♬ Divided we fall, but united we can't be beat ♬

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:26.830
God damn it!

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:31.700
Bring it on!

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:34.410
♬ You're just an uppity punk
asking for a one-on-one ♬

00:20:34.410 --> 00:20:37.040
♬ Me, I'm just dying to see
when you'll start crying ♬

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:39.580
♬ I'm like a finely sharpened blade ♬

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:42.500
♬ And you're swinging a toy like this
is some kinda play date? ♬

00:20:55.330 --> 00:20:58.910
I won't forgive you, Samatoki!

00:20:58.910 --> 00:21:00.700
Lemme have it!

00:21:00.700 --> 00:21:03.370
♬ Clean out your ears, rusty yakuza ♬

00:21:03.370 --> 00:21:05.750
♬ I'm treating this like a serious matter ♬

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:07.080
♬ Honestly, I'm shocked ♬

00:21:07.080 --> 00:21:08.830
♬ These weak thug tactics are atrocious ♬

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:11.330
♬ So I'm puttin' you on notice ♬

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:17.910
Gwahhhhh!

00:21:17.910 --> 00:21:20.410
--It connected!
--Amazing!

00:21:20.410 --> 00:21:22.290
It's all over now.

00:21:25.700 --> 00:21:29.540
This has probably pushed Samatoki's
consciousness beyond its limits.

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:36.830
Wha--?!

00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:40.160
There's <i>no </i>way he could've withstood that...

00:21:42.040 --> 00:21:44.040
He bit his own lip?!

00:21:45.330 --> 00:21:46.750
♬ See? You started cryin' at once ♬

00:21:46.750 --> 00:21:48.000
♬ You're putting me on notice? ♬

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:49.660
♬ What good's that gonna do? ♬

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:51.160
♬ Gotta do things the right way ♬

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:52.750
♬ And aesthetics it ain't! Huh? Huh?! ♬

00:21:52.750 --> 00:21:54.160
♬ Not that there's any point ♬

00:21:54.160 --> 00:21:55.750
♬ in reasoning with a hypocrite ♬

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:05.910
Gwahhhhhhhhh!

00:22:09.540 --> 00:22:13.790
We beat you, Ichiro...

00:22:13.790 --> 00:22:17.000
And the winner is... MAD TRIGGER CREW!
